NOTICE / THIRD-PARTY DATA

This project is a tool that scans publicly available ARTICLE.en_us.html files
from the google/fonts repository[](https://github.com/google/fonts) and extracts
GitHub repository links that are already present in those files.

- The source code of this tool (scripts, GitHub Actions, generated site logic)
  is licensed under the MIT License above.

- Font files themselves remain under their original licenses
  (SIL Open Font License 1.1, Apache 2.0, or Ubuntu Font License),
  as indicated in each family directory of google/fonts.

- The ARTICLE.en_us.html / DESCRIPTION.en_us.html content is third-party
  descriptive text. This tool does not re-license that content. If you
  redistribute any of those HTML files, you must retain their original
  copyright and attribution notices.

- The lists produced by this tool (family names + GitHub URLs) are derived
  factual data extracted from public sources.
